00:000000FE 48C3CE40        	   246:    lsrne  r8, 16 - DATASHIFT     # High 16 bits to low 16 bits with databus shift
00:00000102 88C34240        	   247:    lsleq  r8, DATASHIFT          # low 16 bits with databus shift
